WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:03.900
Before the Eclipse, the sky had a voice.

00:00:05.350 --> 00:00:12.250
Above the clouds of Amatsu, the Star Choir sang the heavens into balance, and the stars listened.

00:00:14.350 --> 00:00:20.430
Her teacher, the Choir's prima voice, promised the girl that their song would never end.

00:00:21.030 --> 00:00:27.830
On the highest island, the monk Kaien had kept the gate of the Sky Shrine alone for nine years,

00:00:27.880 --> 00:00:32.460
guarding a sacred tree that held the seals of the world.

00:00:33.060 --> 00:00:41.380
The shrine's orphan, Kagemaru, was raised beside him by the same master, and passed over for the guardian's seal.

00:00:41.980 --> 00:00:50.180
Far below, in the neon rain of Neo-Kurogane, Raijin was the undefeated champion of the underground duels.

00:00:50.230 --> 00:00:55.730
His mother's katana had been struck by lightning on the night of her funeral.

00:00:56.330 --> 00:01:03.810
In Hangar Zero, a mechanic's son named Haruto Daimon swept the floor beneath two unfinished giants.

00:01:03.860 --> 00:01:08.110
VORN: Never hold back, Haruto. Not in the cockpit. Not in life.

00:01:09.330 --> 00:01:15.360
And at Zenith Academy, Yuzu could split a falling leaf at three hundred metres.

00:01:15.410 --> 00:01:19.110
YUZU: I'll always be the better shot, little brother. Always.

00:01:19.710 --> 00:01:24.060
Then, on the longest day of the year, the sun went black.

00:01:28.710 --> 00:01:34.810
The Eclipse tore the world open. And everyone with a crack in their heart heard it calling.

00:01:35.410 --> 00:01:42.030
The Choir's prima voice knelt beneath a crimson moon, and traded her light for eternal youth.

00:01:42.080 --> 00:01:45.930
NOCTURNE: Forgive me, little star. Some songs must end.

00:01:46.530 --> 00:01:48.900
KAGEMARU: Seals mean nothing. I'll prove it.

00:01:48.950 --> 00:01:52.600
Kagemaru set the sacred tree ablaze.

00:01:58.530 --> 00:02:07.480
With the seals gone, the foundation stone of Neo-Kurogane cracked, and the oni Enra walked out of a thousand years of darkness,

00:02:07.530 --> 00:02:10.460
ENRA: Where is the blade that cut me?

00:02:11.060 --> 00:02:17.710
He burned the district in a single night, searching for the one blade that had ever wounded him.

00:02:17.760 --> 00:02:21.540
He found it in a boy's hands, at a funeral.

00:02:22.140 --> 00:02:30.190
In Hangar Zero, the man Haruto trusted most climbed into the twin frame. Warlord Vorn stole Gorgoth,

00:02:30.240 --> 00:02:34.140
and tore Tenkai-Oh's fist off on his way out.

00:02:34.740 --> 00:02:40.240
And in the rift, a porcelain-masked collector was waiting for lost students.

00:02:40.290 --> 00:02:43.660
HEX: Such a pretty scarf. You'll make a perfect doll.

00:02:44.260 --> 00:02:47.980
Together they became the Umbra Syndicate.

00:02:49.260 --> 00:02:54.310
In one night, five strangers lost everything the Eclipse could take.

00:02:54.910 --> 00:03:01.210
Haruto climbed into a frame with one fist, and a reactor no one had ever woken.

00:03:01.260 --> 00:03:03.860
HARUTO: Come on, Tenkai-Oh. Wake up!

00:03:04.460 --> 00:03:12.060
Mirei stitched new wings from the constellations her teacher had taught her, and flew after the song she had lost.

00:03:12.660 --> 00:03:19.940
Kaien left the mountain for the first time in nine years, with ten thousand talismans, and one name.

00:03:20.540 --> 00:03:26.210
Raijin raised his mother's katana to the storm. Lightning struck it twice.

00:03:26.810 --> 00:03:34.010
And Yuzu kept drawing her bow until the string cut her fingers, waiting for a target worth the shot.

00:03:34.610 --> 00:03:42.280
They did not find each other. The Eclipse found them, all at once, the night the Syndicate came for Zenith Academy.

00:03:42.880 --> 00:03:47.110
One by one, five strangers stepped into the fire.

00:03:58.880 --> 00:04:01.180
VORN: You still hold back, boy.

00:04:01.230 --> 00:04:03.130
HARUTO: Not anymore!

00:04:08.880 --> 00:04:11.880
NOCTURNE: Still singing my lullaby, little star?

00:04:11.930 --> 00:04:14.300
MIREI: No. I'm singing mine.

00:04:15.880 --> 00:04:18.230
KAGEMARU: You can't catch a shadow, brother.

00:04:18.280 --> 00:04:21.650
KAIEN: I don't need to catch it. Only to seal it.

00:04:22.880 --> 00:04:25.200
ENRA: That blade is mine!

00:04:25.250 --> 00:04:27.100
RAIJIN: Then come and take it.

00:04:29.880 --> 00:04:33.000
HEX: Come, little archer. Your brother is waiting.

00:04:33.050 --> 00:04:34.730
YUZU: Let him go.

00:04:36.880 --> 00:04:45.130
A wall of dawnlight. A song of stars. A storm of seals. A blade of lightning. An arrow that does not miss.

00:04:48.880 --> 00:04:54.000
When the sun rose, it rose on five strangers standing in the ruins.

00:04:57.880 --> 00:05:00.310
KAIEN: Then we stand together.

00:05:00.360 --> 00:05:03.440
HARUTO: Never again. Not one more city.

00:05:04.040 --> 00:05:09.360
That morning, they swore an oath. They called themselves the Zenith Vanguard.

00:05:09.960 --> 00:05:15.160
But far above the world, beyond the black sun, someone was watching.

00:05:15.210 --> 00:05:18.740
QEL'VARIS: Five little oath-keepers. How delightful.
